### Peticiones de prueba para event-service (Sesión 3)
### Ejecutables desde IntelliJ IDEA (HTTP Client) o VS Code (extensión REST Client)
### Ejecuta las peticiones en orden sobre una base de datos recién creada (con los datos semilla).

@host = http://localhost:8081/api/v1

### ---------- RECINTOS ----------

### Listar recintos -> 200
GET {{host}}/venues

### Obtener recinto por id -> 200
GET {{host}}/venues/1

### Crear recinto -> 201 + Location
POST {{host}}/venues
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Teatro Peruano Japonés",
  "city": "Lima",
  "address": "Av. Gregorio Escobedo 803, Jesús María",
  "capacity": 1200
}

### Crear recinto inválido -> 400 con lista de errores
POST {{host}}/venues
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "city": "Lima",
  "capacity": 0
}

### ---------- EVENTOS ----------

### Listar todos los eventos (con recinto y zonas en UNA consulta) -> 200
GET {{host}}/events

### Filtrar por ciudad (sin distinguir mayúsculas), categoría y estado -> 200
GET {{host}}/events?city=lima&status=PUBLISHED

### Obtener evento por id -> 200
GET {{host}}/events/1

### Evento inexistente -> 404 (ProblemDetail)
GET {{host}}/events/999

### Zonas (ticket categories) de un evento -> 200
GET {{host}}/events/1/ticket-categories

### S3: Disponibilidad y precio de una zona (lo consulta booking-service) -> 200
GET {{host}}/events/1/ticket-categories/1/availability

### S3: Disponibilidad de una zona que no es del evento -> 404
GET {{host}}/events/1/ticket-categories/4/availability

### Crear evento -> 201 + Location (nace en DRAFT)
POST {{host}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Noche de Stand Up",
  "description": "Comediantes nacionales",
  "category": "COMEDY",
  "venueId": 2,
  "dateTime": "2027-03-01T21:00:00",
  "ticketCategories": [
    {
      "name": "Preferencial",
      "price": 120.0,
      "capacity": 300
    },
    {
      "name": "General",
      "price": 80.0,
      "capacity": 700
    }
  ]
}

### Bean Validation: fecha pasada y zona con precio negativo -> 400
POST {{host}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Evento del pasado",
  "category": "MUSIC",
  "venueId": 1,
  "dateTime": "2020-01-01T20:00:00",
  "ticketCategories": [
    {
      "name": "VIP",
      "price": -10,
      "capacity": 100
    }
  ]
}

### Categoría inexistente -> 400 (JSON ilegible)
POST {{host}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Evento raro",
  "category": "OPERA",
  "venueId": 1,
  "dateTime": "2027-01-01T20:00:00"
}

### Recinto inexistente -> 400
POST {{host}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sin recinto",
  "category": "MUSIC",
  "venueId": 999,
  "dateTime": "2027-01-01T20:00:00"
}

### Zonas superan el aforo del recinto (800) -> 400
POST {{host}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sobreaforo",
  "category": "THEATER",
  "venueId": 3,
  "dateTime": "2027-05-10T19:00:00",
  "ticketCategories": [
    {
      "name": "Platea",
      "price": 90.0,
      "capacity": 900
    }
  ]
}

### Publicar evento sin zonas -> 409
PATCH {{host}}/events/3/publish

### Actualizar evento (agregar zonas al evento 3, que está en DRAFT) -> 200
PUT {{host}}/events/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "La Casa de Bernarda Alba",
  "description": "Clásico de García Lorca",
  "category": "THEATER",
  "venueId": 3,
  "dateTime": "2027-01-20T19:00:00",
  "ticketCategories": [
    {
      "name": "Platea",
      "price": 90.0,
      "capacity": 500
    },
    {
      "name": "Mezzanine",
      "price": 60.0,
      "capacity": 300
    }
  ]
}

### Publicar evento -> 200
PATCH {{host}}/events/3/publish

### Eliminar evento -> 204
DELETE {{host}}/events/2
